    LLM: 'Game: Machiavelli. Type: Rummy/Manipulation. Rules: Play cards to sets (3-4 same rank) or sequences (3+ consecutive same suit). Can manipulate existing table melds. Must play at least one new card from hand per turn or draw. Two decks (104 cards).',
    Player: 'Welcome to Machiavelli. Play cards to the table by forming sets or sequences. The twist? You can rearrange ANY cards already on the table to help you play. Just make sure all cards form valid melds when you finish your turn.',
    objective: 'Be the first to play all cards from your hand onto the table.',
    gameplay: 'On your turn, you must either: 1. Play at least one card from your hand into a valid meld (new or existing). 2. Draw one card from the stock and end your turn.',
